WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,180
Mr. Xiao, I can’t give up.

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,180
That's Xiao Heng

3
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:05,180
Rich and handsome

4
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:07,180
Can you like him as a cleaner?

5
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,180
I saw it with my own eyes

6
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:11,660
I used to live in the same dormitory with him

7
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,660
Thought he was peaceful

8
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,810
I didn't expect him to be this kind of person

9
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,810
Live with this kind of person

10
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:18,810
breathe the same air

11
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:20,810
I almost vomited

12
00:00:20,810 --> 00:00:21,810
You guys have nothing to do

13
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,810
I have forgotten everything about Zhen Zhen and Luna

14
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:24,810
Kindly remind you

15
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,810
Don't miss their morning together

16
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:30,780
Like to listen or not

17
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:35,380
This Annie takes herself seriously

18
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,380
Zhen Zhen and Luna

19
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,380
That is violating the taboo of the superiors

20
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:42,230
I can’t persuade those who seek death

21
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:44,580
Just that Jian Tong

22
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,710
I'm going to suffer again

23
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:49,260
Miss, a total of fifty-six yuan

24
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:53,810
thank you

25
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:55,130
it suddenly occurred to me

26
00:00:55,130 --> 00:00:56,130
It's not a big deal

27
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:58,130
Maybe you don't need this umbrella anymore
